{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Damn, damn, dammity damn!": "",
  "Uh, you gonna be okay? Maybe you should step outside, take a breather?": "",
  "I'm sorry. It's just that when I think about that woman, I get so damn mad...": "",
  "Well, you'll need to tell me what happened if you want my help.": "",
  "...You don't recognize me, do you? I'm actually a stand-up comic.": "",
  "I had everything going for me... Young, handsome, funny... I was on my way up in the comic biz.": "",
  "But I'm on hiatus now. And I don't even know if I can bounce back.": "",
  "And the hiatus relates to why you're here, I take it?": "",
  "My face was plastered all over one of those trashy tabloids this week...": "",
  "I take it you're involved in some kind of scandal?": "",
  "I'll say. Those garbage rags are saying that I got a minor drunk and then took advantage of her.": "",
  "Here, see for yourself.": "",
  "...So the girl was underage. That puts you completely at fault. No gray area here.": "",
  "No, you've got it wrong! She said she was 22 years old!": "",
  "You're saying she lied about her age?": "",
  "Yeah, she said we were about the same age, and we hit it off. The vibe was good, and I was pretty into her...": "",
  "...And you ended up sleeping with her.": "",
  "This was the girl. Her name's Asuka Hachitani.": "",
  "This whole thing has stopped my career dead in its tracks. I can't perform, and I even had to pay agency reparations.": "",
  "On top of that, I'm getting hounded by paparazzi and \"journalists\" everywhere I go! It's terrible!": "",
  "Sure, but can we go back to the part about her lying about her age? That's the key here.": "",
  "Yeah... I thought I was doing the fucking, but I was just getting fucked over... It was a classic honey trap.": "",
  "It sucks, man... The internet is even calling me Horny Hinata... Or just Hornata...": "",
  "It's true what they say... Go to home plate with jailbait, go straight to inmate...": "",
  "(Nobody says that...)": "",
  "Well, I think I'm starting to get the picture. But I'm going to need more details, Hornata-san.": "",
  "It's <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Hinata</font_kind>!": "",
  "O-Oh, right, sorry. It was too catchy.": "",
  "So this girl you slept with... Er... Hachitani-san, the woman who set you up...": "",
  "Are you positive she said she was 22 years old?": "",
  "Yes, I'm not an idiot. I asked her age before we'd even finished the first drink.": "",
  "Hell, I even asked her to show me her driver's license at one point.": "",
  "But the tabloid clearly indicates she's underage. That's quite a contradiction.": "",
  "I know. I don't understand this at all. I know what I saw on her driver's license.": "",
  "...Well, something's not adding up. That's the first thing we need to look into.": "",
  "Can you tell me a little more about the day you met her?": "",
  "Sure. I'd just wrapped up a recording, so I went out to grab drinks with my co-star.": "",
  "His name is Kotatsu Higurashi. He's a comic too, about my age. We're good buddies.": "",
  "Oh, I should have a picture of him... Yeah, that's him right here.": "",
  "Kotatsu said he knew a good spot that night.": "",
  "So we went out drinking at a place called Bantam.": "",
  "(Ah, Bantam. I know it.)": "",
  "But when we got there, Kotatsu said it was pretty lame for a couple guys to be drinking alone...": "",
  "I mean, I didn't mind, but he said he'd call up some girl he'd met recently.": "",
  "Is that the girl in question?": "",
  "Yeah, Asuka Hachitani. Apparently they'd met on a group blind date.": "",
  "That means it was the three of you drinking that night?": "",
  "Yeah, but now that I think about it, she was pouring him drink after drink, and he conked out early and grabbed a cab.": "",
  "So it got to be just the two of us, and like I said, we were hitting it off.": "",
  "She was drinking, she got kinda handsy, and I got kinda... excited.": "",
  "I guess it does sound like the perfect cocktail for the disaster that led you here.": "",
  "Yeah, one thing led to another, and we ended up going to a hotel...": "",
  "Kotatsu is pretty messed up about it, too. He's the only guy who's been out there defending me.": "",
  "He's even tried to take some of the blame himself...": "",
  "I see. I think I'm understanding the \"how\" at least.": "",
  "But what are you hoping I can do, specifically?": "",
  "Yagami-san, I want you to find proof that I was set up.": "",
  "And if you find a way, I'd love to get back at that harpy! I'll pay you 150,000 yen!": "",
  "(Find proof and get revenge, huh? This might be a tough one.)": "",
  "(And I'm going to need to make sure it was a setup in the first place...)": "",
  "...All right, I've heard what I need to get started, I think.": "",
  "I can't promise anything, but I'll take the case.": "",
  "Thank you very much!": "",
  "I'll call you if I make any progress.": "",
  "You're my only hope, man. I'll leave you to it.": "",
  "(First thing I need to do is find this woman, Hachitani...)": "",
  "(Maybe if I head to Bantam, I can get a lead or two.)": "",
  "Hey, mind if I ask you a question? You know this woman?": "",
  "Oh... Yeah, that's Asuka Hachitani.": "",
  "Hm? You do know her?": "",
  "Yeah, I'm a journalist. I take it you're following the Horny Hinata story too?": "",
  "Yeah, something like that. But I don't have much to go on, and I hit a dead end.": "",
  "Well, what a lucky break to run into me. The name's Hiranuma. I'm digging up what I can on Hornata too.": "",
  "I'm Yagami. Have you found anything promising?": "",
  "Nothing I can use. Not yet, anyway. I did find the woman's Chatter account...": "",
  "But she's been pretty cautious. Hasn't posted a thing about the incident.": "",
  "(Chatter, huh? Maybe I could use that to locate her.)": "",
  "Um, I hate to ask, but would you be willing to share her handle?": "",
  "Hm? Sure... But not for free.": "",
  "...How much?": "",
  "Hm, how about...": "",
  "Well, I'm feeling generous, so let's call it a trade. If you get anything good, you give me a call, okay?": "",
  "Really? Are you sure about that?": "",
  "Think of it as an alliance. After all, in our world you've gotta give before you can take, right?": "",
  "(He really does think I'm a journalist.)": "",
  "Here. Her handle and my number.": "",
  "That's a huge help. Thank you.": "",
  "Remember, call me if you find anything, right?": "",
  "(I should start looking into this right away.)": "",
  "...She seems to post about things just after she finishes doing them...": "",
  "(Her last post wasn't too long ago, either. Wonder if I can nail her down with this?)": "",
  "Hm? That guy... Isn't he...?": "",
  "(Why's she with him? I think I better get this conversation on record.)": "",
  "So how's the Horny Hinata thing going? Sounds like a real fiasco.": "",
  "Yeah, he's been super depressed. I think the agency's gonna fire him soon, too.": "",
  "Hehe... Sounds like it's finally your turn to shine, Kotatsu-kun.": "",
  "Yup. Sonuvabitch was getting really cocky lately, too. Serves his dumb ass right.": "",
  "What a fuckin' idiot. He fell for it hook, line, and sinker.": "",
  "He had no freakin' clue how old you were. You shoulda seen his face when he found out...": "",
  "Oh god, I bet it was hilarious.": "",
  "(Yep, this is going places. I better get a photo for insurance.)": "",
  "Hey, you two. Sounds like you've been busy lately.": "",
  "You'd set up a honey trap with your own girl? You're a real bastard, aren't you?": "",
  "Wh-Who the hell are you!?": "",
  "Doesn't matter. But just so you know, I've got a record of that entire conversation you just had.": "",
  "Not to mention a photo of you having a good time with a minor.": "",
  "I bet I know a few magazines who would pay big money for a shot like this.": "",
  "So if I were you, I'd come clean about what really happened.": "",
  "Y-You bastard! Nobody screws with me! I'll fuckin' kill you!": "",
  "...I don't recommend trying.": "",
  "I'm a black belt in karate, motherfucker! You'll be sorry you underestimated me!": "",
  "That pain you're feeling now? I'm sure Hinata-san is going to feel worse when he finds out who betrayed him.": "",
  "Damn it...": "",
  "What was all that about a blackbelt? Pretty pathetic.": "",
  "Wh-What do you want!?": "",
  "The truth.": "",
  "Considering the situation you're in, I don't think you want to go down as this guy's accomplice. So let's hear it.": "",
  "...Kotatsu asked me to.": "",
  "...He did?": "",
  "Yeah, he was jealous of how popular Hinata was getting. So he figured we could set him up and profit off it, too.": "",
  "The whole thing was his idea.": "",
  "So the money was good enough to make you sleep with another guy? How much are we talking?": "",
  "I got the tabloids to pay for the story and Hinata's agency to pay damages... It was about five million in total.": "",
  "Five million? I guess to a minor, that'd be quite a pay day.": "",
  "...I'm not a minor.": "",
  "Really? I had a hunch. How old are you really?": "",
  "I'm 22.": "",
  "So you've been lying about your age the whole time... But how did you convince the tabloid?": "",
  "I pretended to be my little sister, and I showed them her school ID...": "",
  "And they don't publish the names of minors in magazines, so it worked.": "",
  "I see. So now your poor little sister has a rep for sleeping with a guy she's never even met?": "",
  "They didn't publish her name! She's totally safe!": "",
  "Well, it sounds to me like you've got another story to sell, Hachitani-san.": "",
  "Huh? B-But...": "",
  "You're going to say Higurashi here threatened you into doing it, but your <font_kind=yakuza_italic>moral compass</font_kind> made you come clean.": "",
  "But... That would be betraying Kotatsu...": "",
  "It would. But have you considered how well it's going to pay?": "",
  "Oh...! I'll do it!": "",
  "(Classy as they come...)": "",
  "Oh, Hiranuma-san? I just wanted to thank you for giving me that tip.": "",
  "Oh, hey. Did you find any leads?": "",
  "Forget leads. I've got the whole scoop.": "",
  "Oh? Do go on!": "",
  "I'd say the public and the media are in for quite a shocker...": "",
  "And I've got the proof and a witness all lined up. So... You interested?": "",
  "...Very! Let's hear it.": "",
  "So the short version is, Higurashi coerced you into setting up Hinata? Do I have that straight?": "",
  "Yep, that's the whole story.": "",
  "This is incredible. Yagami-san... Are you sure you're okay with giving me the exclusive?": "",
  "Yeah, I don't mind. I'm not even a real journalist.": "",
  "I'm sorry I lied, but I'm actually a local detective. I didn't mean to trick you.": "",
  "Why didn't you just say so from the start? But that sure makes for an interesting spin, huh?": "",
  "I'm looking forward to your article.": "",
  "Leave it to me! I'm gonna head straight back to the office and start typing it up!": "",
  "And Yagami-san... If you ever get any more scoops like this, I hope you'll call me! And if I've got info, it's yours.": "",
  "Gotta give before you take, right?": "",
  "Yup! See ya around!": "",
  "I've gotta say, watching Kotatsu's press conference was really satisfying.": "",
  "I hear he's on an indefinite hiatus.": "",
  "Yeah, his whole stand-up shtick is getting angry at the drop of a hat, but he was sobbing like a baby.": "",
  "And thanks to you, I'll be back up on stage myself pretty soon.": "",
  "Congratulations.": "",
  "It's all thanks to you, Yagami-san. I am forever in your debt!": "",
  "Nah. I just went where the truth took me.": "",
  "No way, man! I owe you a drink at the least!": "",
  "Sure, but wouldn't it be kind of lame for a couple of guys to go out drinking? Maybe I should call up a girl.": "",
  "Dude, give me a break...": "",
  "Haha, too easy, man.": "",
  "I'll see you soon!": "",
  "Welcome, sir. What can I get you?": "",
  "Oh, actually, I just had a question for you.": "",
  "More of you, huh?": "",
  "This is about Horny Hinata, right? Ever since that story broke, I've had a steady stream of reporters snooping around.": "",
  "You guys are interfering with my business, you know.": "",
  "I'm sorry to hear that...": "",
  "And all I can tell you is that I don't remember much about it.": "",
  "Even small details help. Is there anything in particular you remember?": "",
  "It's exactly what the tabloids are saying.": "",
  "Two men were drinking, then a young woman joined them...": "",
  "And then one of the guys left, followed by the two of them a while later. That's all.": "",
  "And you're sure those two were the ones in the tabloid, right?": "",
  "Yes, I'm quite certain.": "",
  "(Well, I've confirmed Hinata-san's story so far, but I don't have any leads on this Hachitani woman...)": "",
  "(Oh well. Guess I'll have to hit the streets.)": "",
  "(Or maybe I could ask around to see if anyone's seen her.)": "",
  "Hey, Yosuke-kun. You got a minute?": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san? What's up, you finally cave in to the thirst for some titties?": "",
  "(...Right, Yosuke-kun's a sex shop barker. Maybe he's even seen Hachitani.)": "",
  "Actually, I'm just looking for someone. Have you seen this woman?": "",
  "Hmm. Can't say that I have.": "",
  "Oh, I have.": "",
  "Really? Where?": "",
  "I'll tell ya for 10k.": "",
  "You're trying to sell it?": "",
  "Sorry about this guy, Yagami-san. He's got a nose for cash.": "",
  "(What should I do? I've got her Chatter, so I might be able to find it myself...)": "",
  "Fine. I'll pay. 10,000 yen.": "",
  "Thanks for doin' business!": "",
  "(Oh wait, I don't even have that much.)": "",
  "I can't pay that. I'll be back.": "",
  "Sure thing. I'll be around!": "",
  "I'm not paying that!": "",
  "Oh? You're gonna pay the 10k?": "",
  "I think I saw her walking down West Taihei Boulevard a second ago.": "",
  "Really? That's perfect!": "",
  "(Combined with what I can glean from her Chatter, she's probably in a fast food joint on West Taihei Boulevard.)": "",
  "(Am I in time? Does anyone here look like Hachitani?)": "",
  "(There's three young women here. Hachitani's distinguishing features are...)": "",
  "(I need to inspect the women's faces carefully, and then I can approach.)": "",
  "(That's weird. None of the women match her description completely.)": "",
  "(That woman with glasses has clearly different characteristics... Hm?)": "",
  "(The blonde woman is going to leave, but the woman with a mole beneath her eye is still here.)": "",
  "(Should I follow the blonde?)": "",
  "(I can't say for sure, but I probably should, just in case.)": "",
  "Hello? Ko-kun? Yeah. Mmhm. I'm at Wette Kitchen right now.": "",
  "(Hm? \"Ko-kun\"? Is that a guy?)": "",
  "What!? Really!? Yeah, of course I want to see you!": "",
  "Hm? Nah, same old me. What? You like me blonde?": "",
  "(...Hm? Maybe the blonde hair from the tabloid was a wig?)": "",
  "(That was close. I was chasing the wrong lady.)": "",
  "(Wait, the woman with a mole below her eye... Ignoring the hair, the features match up.)": "",
  "(But hair's easy enough to change with a wig...)": "",
  "(Of the three, there's a good chance that woman is Hachitani.)": "",
  "(Ko-kun? Is that a guy?)": "",
  "(...Bingo. I knew it was a wig.)": "",
  "Uh-huh, got it! I'll be right there!": "",
  "(Is she going to meet with her boyfriend? But she slept with Hinata-san, so...)": "",
  "(Well, that doesn't prove she set him up or anything, but it sure does make her scummy if that's the case...)": "",
  "(I need to see where this goes. I should probably tail her.)": "",
  "(Hm, they don't match the profile. Not the one...)": "",
  "Excuse me, are you the one who requested a PI?": "",
  "Oh, yes. You must be Yagami-san, then? I'm Kawada.": "",
  "Nice to meet you, Kawada-san. What can I do for you?": "",
  "Well, let me start by saying I'm an editor at a small publishing company called Cloudy Skies Publishing.": "",
  "The thing is, we've been struggling recently.": "",
  "If we don't publish a hit soon, the whole company may end up folding...": "",
  "It's that bad, huh?": "",
  "I'm afraid so. I've been racking my brain about it, but that's when I saw what could be our lucky break.": "",
  "Yes. Have you ever heard of Takumi Katagiri? He's a mystery writer.": "",
  "Oh yeah, he writes the \"Falco Edison\" series, right? I've read <font_kind=yakuza_italic>The Killing Lightbulb</font_kind>.": "",
  "Oh, so you know him! He's actually going to be announcing his new book soon.": "",
  "And I was wondering if you could attend the announcement event with us.": "",
  "Me? Why?": "",
  "It's more than just an announcement, you see. He's going to award publishing rights for his book at the same time.": "",
  "Publishing rights?": "",
  "Of course. No publisher in its right mind wouldn't want Katagiri-sensei's newest.": "",
  "Whenever he writes anything new, publishers get worked into a frenzy trying to get it.": "",
  "I guess everyone wants the safe bet.": "",
  "Very much so. And the big publishers always muscle out the smaller guys like us.": "",
  "That's business for you.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Here, see for yourself.": "นี่ ดูเองสิ",
  "Thank you very much!": "ขอบคุณมากๆ เลย!",
  "Damn it...": "บ้าเอ๊ย...",
  "Huh? B-But...": "หา? แ-แต่...",
  "Congratulations.": "ขอแสดงความยินดีด้วยค่ะ",
  "Welcome, sir. What can I get you?": "ยินดีต้อนรับค่ะ รับอะไรดีคะ?",
  "I'm sorry to hear that...": "เสียใจด้วยจริงๆ นะ..."
 }
}
